OL,3,GNEWSAScotland 'not like Manchester',
OL,4,ASwinney says in dig at PM Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has taken aim at those who
OL,7,Fthink Scotland "should be just like
OL,8,FManchester" as he vowed Scotland would
OL,9,Fsoon be an independent nation.
OL,11,FIn a closing SNP conference speech that
OL,12,Fdid not mention Prime Minister Andy
OL,13,FBurnham by name, Swinney hit back at
OL,14,Fthe former Greater Manchester mayor
OL,15,Fafter he visited Scotland on Friday.
OL,17,FSwinney, addressing party members in
OL,18,FAberdeen, also announced that the
OL,19,Fcountry's bus network would be brought
OL,20,Funder public control by the end of the
OL,21,Fparliamentary term in 2031.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
